      <mri:abstract>
        <gco:CharacterString>
The Hawaii Cropland Data Layer (HCDL) is a raster, geo-referenced, crop-specific land cover dataset at 10 meter spatial resolution for 2023 and 2024. HCDL leveraged geospatial embeddings from AlphaEarth Foundations Satellite Embedding and ground-reference data from the University of Hawaii at Manoa field surveys (Dec 2023 to Oct 2024). No farmer reported data are derivable from the CDL. ASCII spelling Hawaii is used for compatibility.
        </gco:CharacterString>
      </mri:abstract>

